  "content": "<h2>Примечания</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Если мод не запускается, попробуйте использовать последнюю версию Forge.</li>\n<li>Внутриигровой интерфейс <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fAdvancement\" rel=\"nofollow\">Достижений</a> содержит инструкции по использованию мода.</li>\n<li>Фумо можно подбирать и вращать, удерживая клавишу Shift и взаимодействуя с ними.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Благодарности</h2>\n<p>[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskin%252freimu-fumo-touhou-project%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bootleg Reimu</a>]\n[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskin%252fkirisame-marisa-5716667%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Marisa</a>]\n[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskin%252fshiki-eiki-yamazanadu%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eiki</a>]\n[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskin%252fcirno-5702116%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cirno</a>]\n[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskin%252ftanned-cirno%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tan Cirno</a>]\n[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskin%252fchen-touhou-project-5282531%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chen</a>]\n[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskin%252freimu-5448033%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Reimu</a>]\n[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskin%252fkomeiji-koishi-touhou-project%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Koishi</a>]\n[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskin%252fflandre-scarlet-touhou-project-5320723%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Flandre</a>]\n[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskin%252fhong-meiling-touhou-project%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Meiling</a>]\n[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskin%252fkonpaku-youmu-touhou-project-5812902%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Youmu</a>]\n[Yuyuko=<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskin%252fhong-meiling-touhou-project%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Meiling</a>+<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskin%252fpatchouli-knowledge-touhou-project-5564037%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patchouli</a>]\n[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskin%252fpatchouli-knowledge-touhou-project-5564037%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patchouli</a>]\n[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskin%252fnitori-kawashiro-5940728%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nitori</a>]\n[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskin%252ftewi-inaba-touhou-project%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tewi</a>]\n[Nazrin=<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskin%252fhong-meiling-touhou-project%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Meiling</a>+<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskin%252fnazrin-touhou-project-anime-game%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nazrin</a>]\n[<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fskin%252fsunny-milk-5837094%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sunny Milk</a>]</p>",
